# No GetComponent in Update

Do not call `GetComponent`, `GetComponentInParent`, `GetComponentInChildren`, or `Find` from `Update`, `LateUpdate`, or `FixedUpdate`.

If a one-time lookup on another object seems unavoidable, ask first. Do not add it silently.

When a hold/hover/target starts, resolve once and cache. When it ends, clear the cache.

```csharp
// BAD — lookup every LateUpdate
private void LateUpdate() {
    if (TryGetArmPoint(_holderNetId, out Transform arm) == false)
        return;
}

// GOOD — cache on bind, clear on release
private Transform _armPoint;

private void OnHolderChanged(uint previous, uint current) {
    if (current == 0) {
        _armPoint = null;
        return;
    }

    _armPoint = ResolveArmPoint(current);
}

private void LateUpdate() {
    if (_armPoint == null)
        return;
}
```
